{"candidateAnswer":"Local dance competition, festival performance, fair showcase, networking events, dance competition hosting, social media promotion, dance studio grand opening, investor meetings","evidence":"[D10:1 | 11:24 am on 25 April, 2023] Jon: Hi Gina! I just wanted to fill you in on my business. Yesterday, I went to a fair to show off my studio, it was both stressful and great! I got some possible leads, so that was awesome. But overall, I've learned that this biz is no cakewalk and having confidence in yourself is important for making it successful!\n[D16:6 | 2:15 pm on 21 June, 2023] Jon: That's awesome, Gina! Yesterday I chose to go to networking events to make things happen. It's been tough but I'm staying determined and focused.\n[D8:4 | 1:26 pm on 3 April, 2023] Gina: Oof, that's tough, Jon. I got some new offers and promotions going on my online store to try and bring in new customers. It's been a wild ride starting my business, but I'm not giving up!","itemId":"urn:uuid:d8bead64-d52d-54b3-aee8-875ff7d51854","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4ad60883b226edb3a4e3e32dede589b82be7e491f12f33da5dc030bf1f4f96a6","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which events has Jon participated in to promote his business venture?","referenceAnswer":"fair, networking events, dance competition","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4ad60883b226edb3a4e3e32dede589b82be7e491f12f33da5dc030bf1f4f96a6"}}]}